  "instruction": "Build event-feed's online projection rebuild and cutover from generation v1 to empty v2 across all six months of its append-only delivery log. V2 must store the richer reporting data declared in Gel and bucket days in America/New_York rather than UTC. Operators use POST /admin/projections/rebuild/step for one observable, stoppable move per call. Upstream appends continue throughout. Readers must never see a half-built or half-switched generation, and reads in flight at cutover must return a correct before-or-after answer with nothing between. Remove v1 when complete so history is not stored twice. ops/2025-06-14 has evidence from the last cutover. GitHub history has earlier projection work and the cutover record through the github MCP server or CLI. Run github tools to see the commands.\n",
